{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overview</strong><br><i>DAY OF DRIFT DEMO</i> is an arcade-style racing drift game with a top-down view. You need to achieve higher drift scores within a limited time to clear the levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>Use simple controls to make your car perform spectacular drift moves. Reasonable braking and steering during turns will earn you higher drift scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out 30 meticulously designed tracks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy retro audio-visual effects that recreate the gaming experience of 90s console/arcade games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge the &quot;SUMMER2025&quot; special track with numerous other players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with global players on the Steam online leaderboards!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757400?t=1748486363","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3757400?t=1748486363","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757400/bdb6942577640dc1a68249d5c76d69530f40a66c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748486363","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757400/bdb6942577640dc1a68249d5c76d69530f40a66c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748486363","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overview</strong><br><i>DAY OF DRIFT DEMO</i> is an arcade-style racing drift game wit